@page "/"
@* This page uses an interactive Blueprint primitive (BbButton), so it opts into a
   Server circuit. The Account auth pages deliberately do NOT - they stay static. *@
@rendermode InteractiveServer

<PageTitle>ZWarden</PageTitle>

<h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">ZWarden</h1>
<p class="mt-1 text-muted-foreground">
    Feature 0 engineering foundation - the UI pipeline is wired: Blazor Blueprint under
    ZWarden-owned components over Tailwind utilities.
</p>

@* Tailwind utilities (grid-cols-*, gap-*, sm:*) are the ones generated ONLY by running
   the Tailwind build over this markup - the exact classes the stale-app.css guard exists
   to protect. *@
<div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3">
    <StatusBadge Status="ServerStatus.Healthy" />
    <StatusBadge Status="ServerStatus.Degraded" />
    <StatusBadge Status="ServerStatus.Unhealthy" />
</div>

<div class="mt-6">
    <BbButton>A Blueprint primitive, under the seam</BbButton>
</div>
